flowchart TD
    Intent[Immutable Order Intent Envelope]
    Engine[Central Pre-Trade RiskEngine]
    Policy[Versioned Risk Policy Provider]
    Context[Pre-Trade Context Provider]
    Account[Broker Account Identity and Balance Snapshot]
    Instrument[Canonical Instrument and Broker Specification]
    Quote[Timestamped Provider Bid and Ask Quote]
    Portfolio[Intent-Bound Portfolio Risk Projection]
    Controls[Trading Enabled and Emergency Halt Controls]
    Validate[Identity, Environment, Provenance, Freshness and Exact-Decimal Checks]
    Outcome{Risk Decision}
    Authorized[AUTHORIZED Risk Assessment]
    Rejected[REJECTED Risk Assessment]
    Held[HELD Risk Assessment]
    Journal[(Future Assessment / Audit Persistence)]
    OMS[OMS Requires Exact Persisted Intent and AUTHORIZED Assessment]

    Intent --> Engine
    Policy --> Engine
    Context --> Engine
    Account --> Context
    Instrument --> Context
    Quote --> Context
    Portfolio --> Context
    Engine --> Validate
    Validate --> Controls
    Controls --> Outcome
    Outcome -->|All gates pass| Authorized
    Outcome -->|Policy or safety constraint breached| Rejected
    Outcome -->|Missing, stale, invalid or unavailable evidence| Held
    Authorized -. future persistence integration .-> Journal
    Journal -. exact authorization required .-> OMS

    style Authorized fill:#e7f5ec,stroke:#287a48,color:#163d27
    style Rejected fill:#fdecec,stroke:#b42318,color:#65120e
    style Held fill:#fff4df,stroke:#a66a00,color:#5c3a00
